                ^
select  '{1x}'::roaringbitmap;
ERROR:  malformed bitmap literal
LINE 1: select  '{1x}'::roaringbitmap;
                ^
select  '{-x}'::roaringbitmap;
ERROR:  invalid input syntax for integer: "-x}"
